config EMBT_THREAD_PRIORITY_BASE
	int "NuttX priority reference"
	range 1 255
	default 150
	help
	  Preserve the original priority numbering. The native priority is
	  this reference minus the requested priority; validate the result
	  against the target scheduler range without clipping or fallback.
	  The POSIX implementation detects NuttX through __NuttX__ in C.
	  Linux keeps its default pthread attributes and ignores this value.
